This project is an unofficial open-source Google Play delivery client.
It is not affiliated with Google LLC or Aurora OSS.

Runtime third-party services/libraries:
- Google Play Android FDFE / Google delivery CDN
- Aurora anonymous authentication dispenser: https://auroraoss.com/api/auth
- Cloudflare Workers: project-owned transport/backend
- JSZip 3.10.1 loaded from jsDelivr

The application does not use APKCombo, APKPure, APKMirror or other APK mirror/catalogue providers.

The Cloudflare Worker is a constrained transport layer. It does not store APK files and is not designed as a general-purpose proxy. Google delivery files are streamed from allowed Google hosts to the requesting user.

The browser does not request the user's personal Google credentials. Temporary anonymous auth data may be cached locally in the browser. External services remain subject to their own terms, availability, logging and licenses.

The Google Play FDFE protocol is unofficial/reverse engineered and may change without notice.

AI-assisted engineering attribution is documented in CONTRIBUTORS.md and relevant commit history.
